sequenceDiagram
    participant Provider as Stripe/Chapa/Telebirr
    participant Endpoint as POST /webhooks/{provider}
    participant Inbox as Webhook Inbox Table
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant Verifier as Provider Client<br/>(HMAC-SHA256)
    participant DB as Payment Intent + Ledger
    participant Merchant as Merchant Webhook
    
    Note over Provider,Merchant: PHASE 1: RECEIVE (Fast, Never Fail)
    
    Provider->>+Endpoint: POST /webhooks/stripe<br/>Header: Stripe-Signature<br/>Body: {event}
    
    Endpoint->>Endpoint: Extract provider_event_id<br/>(Stripe: event.id)
    
    Endpoint->>+Inbox: INSERT INTO webhooks<br/>(provider, provider_event_id, payload, signature)<br/>ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    
    alt First Delivery
        Inbox-->>Endpoint: Row inserted
        Endpoint-->>-Provider: 200 OK (fast ACK)
    else Duplicate Delivery
        Inbox-->>Endpoint: No row (conflict on provider_event_id)
        Endpoint-->>-Provider: 200 OK (duplicate swallowed)
    end
    
    Note over Provider,Merchant: PHASE 2: PROCESS (Async, Transactional)
    
    loop Every 10 seconds
        Worker->>+Inbox: SELECT * FROM webhooks<br/>WHERE status = 'pending'<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED<br/>LIMIT 1
        Inbox-->>-Worker: webhook row (locked)
        
        Worker->>+Verifier: VerifyWebhook(payload, signature)
        
        alt Valid Signature
            Verifier->>Verifier: Parse t=timestamp,v1=hmac
            Verifier->>Verifier: Compute HMAC-SHA256<br/>(secret, timestamp + "." + payload)
            Verifier->>Verifier: Constant-time compare
            Verifier->>Verifier: Check timestamp skew < 5min<br/>(replay protection)
            Verifier-->>Worker: ✓ Verified event
            
            Worker->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
            Worker->>DB: UPDATE payment_intents<br/>SET status = 'succeeded'<br/>WHERE provider_tx_id = $1<br/>AND status NOT IN ('succeeded','refunded')
            
            alt Payment Transitioned
                Worker->>DB: INSERT INTO ledger_entries<br/>(3 rows: debit provider, credit merchant, credit fees)<br/>Validate SUM(amount) = 0
                Worker->>DB: COMMIT
                DB-->>-Worker: Success
                Worker->>Inbox: UPDATE webhooks SET status = 'processed'
                
                Worker->>+Merchant: Enqueue outbound webhook<br/>event_type: payment.succeeded
                Merchant-->>-Worker: Queued
                
            else Already Succeeded
                Worker->>DB: ROLLBACK (no-op)
                DB-->>-Worker: Idempotent
                Worker->>Inbox: UPDATE webhooks SET status = 'processed'
            end
            
        else Invalid Signature
            Verifier-->>-Worker: ✗ Verification failed
            Worker->>Inbox: INCREMENT attempts<br/>SET last_error = 'signature mismatch'
            
            alt attempts < 5
                Worker->>Inbox: Keep status = 'pending'<br/>(retry later)
            else attempts >= 5
                Worker->>Inbox: SET status = 'failed'<br/>(dead letter)
            end
        end
    end
    
    Note over Provider,Merchant: Security Guarantees:<br/>1. HMAC-SHA256 signature verification<br/>2. Timestamp-based replay protection (5min window)<br/>3. Constant-time signature comparison<br/>4. Provider event ID deduplication<br/>5. Atomic DB transactions (status + ledger together)
